                                                "sense_id": "35b31985-dbf7-3315-a7cd-9762a9e56763",
                                                "text": "Michigan Sen. Elissa Slotkin on Wednesday called for “action, not words” from Democrats, criticizing the approach of some in the progressive wing of the party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e113b10d-e662-4aa2-b2e0-6a9722ed8dce",
                                                "sense_id": "35b31985-dbf7-3315-a7cd-9762a9e56763",
                                                "text": "And that history of persecution is newly relevant after the mass shooting and arson targeting an LDS church in Michigan last Sunday."
